      "description": "## Overview\n[std/net/http](https://pkg.go.dev/net/http) is a Go standard library package std/net/http\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Insertion of Sensitive Information Into Sent Data. <br><br>**Go Vulnerability Report:**<br>\r\nProxy-Authorization and Proxy-Authenticate headers persisted on cross-origin redirects potentially leaking sensitive information.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `std/net/http` to version 1.23.10, 1.24.4 or higher.\n## References\n- [Go Advisory](https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2025-3751)\n- [Go Commit](https://go.dev/cl/679257)\n- [Go Issue](https://go.dev/issue/73816)\n- [Google Groups Forum](https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/ufZ8WpEsA3A)\n",
